@page "/privacy"
<PageTitle>Admin privacy</PageTitle>
<h1>Admin data use — policy draft</h1>
<p>This interface processes account emails, roles, MFA state, file metadata and audit events returned by administrator-authorized API endpoints. Authentication tokens are held in the server-side session circuit. Logout clears the local session and attempts refresh-token revocation.</p>
<p>Access is for authorized administration. Retention, operator contact, hosting logs, processor details and deletion procedures remain operator decisions. No finalized privacy policy or compliance certification is established.</p>
<p>The backend stores uploaded content and artifacts. This dashboard does not provide account deletion, role editing or a retention management control.</p>
